/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/035.md:109:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/035.md:110:  - object:横条, h_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/035.md:111:  - object:竖条, v_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/035.md:112:  - relation:交叉网络, crossing_network
