/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/012.md:152:## 5. 颜色轮转的旋转对称修复
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/012.md:153:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/012.md:154:- tags:
