/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/015.md:47:  - object:遮挡块, occluder_block
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/015.md:48:  - object:被擦中心, erased_center
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/015.md:49:  - relation:对角邻接, diagonal_adjacency
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/015.md:50:  - relation:正交邻接, orthogonal_adjacency
