/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:8:## 1. 缠框层序决定面板叠放
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:11:  - operation:透明叠加, transparent_overlay
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:12:  - operation:排序, sort
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:13:  - object:矩形边框, rect_frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:14:  - object:颜色面板, color_panel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:15:  - relation:交叉处可见性, crossing_visibility
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:16:  - relation:层级优先, layer_priority
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:17:  - condition:遮挡链定优先序, occlusion_chain_sets_priority
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:18:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:19:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:20:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:21:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:22:一句话总述
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:23:- 从交叠矩形框群读出层叠次序，并按该次序把等尺寸颜色面板透明叠加成一张输出图。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:25:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:26:- 背景为最常见色。网格一侧是若干个一像素厚、互相部分交叠的单色矩形框；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:27:  每处交叠点只显示其中一框的颜色，全部交叠关系连成一条覆盖所有框色的链。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:28:- 网格另一侧并排放着数个同尺寸矩形面板，面板之间以背景隔开；每个面板由
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:29:  背景和单一前景色构成，前景色与框色一一对应。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:30:- 面板的排列顺序与框的层叠顺序无关（诱饵：按左右排列叠加在第一个示例
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:31:  之外均不成立）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:32:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:33:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:34:- 由每个颜色可见像素的包围框恢复各矩形框的完整周界；在两框周界相交处，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:35:  可见颜色属于上层框，据此建立"下压→上盖"的有向关系，串成唯一的自底
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:36:  向顶全序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:37:- 将各面板视为透明图层，颜色对应的框越靠顶层，其面板优先级越高。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:38:- 输出与单个面板同尺寸：每个像素取所有面板中优先级最高的非背景色；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:39:  若全部为背景则输出背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:40:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:41:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:42:- 面板在画面上的左右排列只是摆放，真正的叠放次序写在另一处框群的遮挡
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:43:  关系里；这是一道"钥匙在别处"的叠加题。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:44:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:45:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:46:## 2. 反向像素放大找瑕疵
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:47:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:48:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:49:  - operation:降采样, downscale
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:50:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:51:  - object:多色瓦片, polychrome_tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:52:  - object:瑕疵像素, defect_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:53:  - relation:众数原型, majority_prototype
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:54:  - condition:瓦片副本对照原型, copy_vs_prototype
