/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:121:## 4. 四扇错位取景窗与底图贴片
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:122:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:123:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:124:  - operation:平移, translate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:125:  - operation:补全, completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/030.md:126:  - object:分隔十字, separator_cross
