/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:123:  - object:实心滑块, solid_slider
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:124:  - object:尾部向量, tail_vector
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:125:  - object:边缘墙体, edge_wall
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:126:  - relation:接触传递, contact_propagation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:127:  - relation:尾长为推力上限, tail_as_force_budget
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/040.md:128:  - condition:间隙逐段坍缩, gaps_collapse_in_order
