/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:8:## 1. 错位互补的壁纸双窗
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:10:- 参考题目题号: `10 (d47aa2ff)`, `14 (c663677b)`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:12:  - operation:周期推断, period_inference
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/032.md:13:  - operation:逐像素比较, pixel_comparison
