/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/002.md:186:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/002.md:187:  - operation:搬移, relocate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/002.md:188:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
