/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/002.md:190:  - object:象限精灵体, quadrant_sprite
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/002.md:191:  - relation:质心偏移寻址, centroid_bias_addressing
