/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:6:## 1. 演示定光学
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:7:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:8:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:9:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:10:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:11:  - operation:裁剪, crop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:12:  - object:示范面板, demo_panel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:13:  - object:对角射线种子, diagonal_ray_seed
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:14:  - object:反射镜段, mirror_segment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:15:  - relation:示范到输出面板, demo_to_output_panel
