/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:115:  - object:嵌入标记像素, embedded_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:116:  - relation:颜色配对, color_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/054.md:117:  - relation:指针成环, pointer_cycle
