/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:69:## 3. 螺旋仪表守恒反推
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:70:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:71:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:72:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:73:  - operation:补全, reconstruct
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:74:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:75:  - object:仪表盘, gauge_input
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:76:  - object:竖管, tube
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/022.md:77:  - object:挡板, cover_plate
