/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/020.md:14:  - object:网格边界, grid_edge
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/020.md:15:  - relation:碰撞阻挡, collision_blocking
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/020.md:16:  - condition:凸头定向, nub_points_direction
