/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:105:## 4. 波前触序
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:106:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:107:- 标签:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:108:  - 操作:洪泛填充, 重涂色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:109:  - 对象:墙体, 源点, 前景团块, 图例行
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:110:  - 关系:测地距离排序
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:111:  - 条件:触及次序对应图例序色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:112:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:113:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:115:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:116:一句话总述
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:117:波从源点出发沿背景绕墙扩散，按首次触及各团块的先后顺序，用图例行给出的颜色序列
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:118:依次给团块整体重染。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:119:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:120:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:121:- 网格内含灰色墙体、一个青色源点像素、若干个橙色团块。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:122:- 最底一行为图例行：左起排列 k 个颜色像素，k 等于团块个数；图例行与主画面之间
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:123:  隔着整行背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:124:- 各团块到源点的最短绕行距离互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:125:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:126:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:127:- 波从源点沿背景做四连通扩散，墙体与团块均不可穿越。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:128:- 按波首次接触的先后（即绕行最短距离由小到大），第 i 个被触及的团块整体染成图例
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:129:  行左起第 i 个颜色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:130:- 墙体、源点与图例行原样保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:131:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:132:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:133:排序量是绕过墙体的路径距离而不是直线距离——直线上离源点最近的团块可能隔着一堵墙
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:134:反而排在最后；不比出真实的绕行远近，就会得到错误的颜色分配。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/009.md:135:```
