/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:126:## 4. 标记半区的货舱
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:127:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:128:- 参考题目: 18、2、5
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:129:- 难度评审: 达标
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:130:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/039.md:131:  - operation:重力下落, gravity_drop
