/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:8:## 1. 面板拓扑决定叠放次序
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:10:- 参考题目: `281123b4`, `44d8ac46`, `5d2a5c43`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:12:  - operation:透明叠加, transparent_overlay
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:13:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:14:  - object:面板, panel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:15:  - object:分隔列, separator_column
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:16:  - object:孔洞, hole
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:17:  - relation:图层优先级, layer_priority
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:18:  - condition:孔洞数决定层序, hole_count_sets_depth
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:20:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:22:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:23:将分隔线分开的各面板透明叠加为一幅图，叠放前后次序由每个面板图形自身的封闭孔洞数决定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:25:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:26:- 网格被若干整列分隔线分成 3~4 个同尺寸面板。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:27:- 每个面板含背景 0 与恰一种前景色，各面板前景色互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:28:- 各面板前景形状的封闭孔洞数（被前景围死的背景连通域个数）互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:29:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:30:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:31:- 将各面板按位置对齐、视 0 为透明，叠加为一个面板尺寸的输出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:32:- 层序按孔洞数从多到少排列，孔洞最多的形状在最前。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:33:- 每格输出自前向后第一个非背景色，全空处保持 0。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:34:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:35:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:36:- 层序既不由面板位置也不由像素多少决定（首个示例中位置序恰与孔洞序一致，是诱饵）；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:37:  隐藏的排序键是各形状自身的拓扑属性——封闭孔洞的数量。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:38:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:39:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:40:## 2. 残片沿环并集重建
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:41:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/034.md:42:- 参考题目: `ad173014`, `72322fa7`, `5d2a5c43`, `f9d67f8b`
