/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:113:## 4. 极值区域负片换装
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:115:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:116:  - operation:平铺, tiling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:117:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:118:  - object:种子图案, seed_pattern
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:119:  - object:分隔线, divider_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/026.md:120:  - relation:面积比较, area_comparison
