/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:118:## 4. 缺角定位、方位取色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:119:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:120:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:121:  - operation:补全, complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:122:  - operation:查表取色, color_lookup
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:123:  - object:三角标组, three_corner_group
