/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:153:## 5. 色条是尺寸指令而非计数汇报
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:154:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:155:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:156:  - operation:筛选, filter
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:157:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:158:  - object:指令色条, instruction_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:159:  - object:四连通物体, four_conn_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:160:  - relation:同色配对, same_color_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:161:  - condition:面积等于条长, size_equals_bar_length
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:162:- 参考题目题号: 12、4
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:163:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:164:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:165:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:166:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:167:顶部色条是先行下达的尺寸指令：只保留像素数恰好等于同色条长度的物体。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:168:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:169:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:170:- 顶部是黑色指令区，含若干从第 0 列起的水平色条，各色至多一条，长度
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:171:  互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:172:- 下方场景面板有自己的非黑背景色，散布多个 4 连通彩色物体；同色物体
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:173:  可有多个，且大小各不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:174:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:175:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:176:- 面板中每个物体：若其颜色在指令区有对应色条，且物体像素数恰好等于
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:177:  该色条的长度，则保留；否则涂成面板背景色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:178:- 颜色未出现在指令区的物体一律删除。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:179:- 指令区原样保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:180:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:181:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:182:- 因果方向与直觉相反——色条不是对面板物体的统计汇报，而是筛选阈值；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:183:  第一个示例中每种颜色恰好只有一个等长物体，极易误读成"条长等于物体
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:184:  计数"或"输出汇总条"，后续示例才暴露真正的匹配方向。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:185:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:186:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:187:## 6. 周期条带叠加颜色轮转的修复
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:188:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:189:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:190:  - operation:补全, complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:191:  - operation:色环推进, color_cycle_step
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:192:  - object:周期条带, periodic_band
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:193:  - object:缺失像素, missing_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:194:  - relation:平移加置换, translation_plus_permutation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:195:  - condition:步数随距离累积, steps_accumulate_with_distance
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:196:- 参考题目题号: 1、9
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:197:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:198:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:199:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:200:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:201:修复黑洞必须同时用上"图案按竖条带周期重复"与"每重复一次全部颜色沿
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:202:固定置换环推进一步"的复合规律。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:203:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:204:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:205:- 网格由一个宽 w 的基础竖条带向右反复拼接而成；但每拼接一次，条带内
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:206:  所有颜色都按同一个颜色置换环前进一步。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:207:- 若干像素被擦成黑色缺口；黑色不出现在置换环中。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:208:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:209:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:210:- 由未缺损区域确定条带宽 w 与颜色置换环（含环上的不动点颜色）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:211:- 对每个黑洞：取同一行中列号与其相差 w 的整数倍的任一已知像素，把该
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:212:  像素的颜色沿置换环推进相应的条带数步，得到填充色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:213:- 输出为完全修复后的网格。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:214:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:215:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:216:- 这不是普通的平铺修复——相邻条带对应格的颜色并不相等，而是"轮转一
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:217:  档"；置换环上恰好安排了不动点颜色作掩护，使前两条带乍看像纯周期，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:218:  只有对不上的颜色才逼出隐藏的置换层。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:219:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:220:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:221:## 7. 双墙投影重建隐形矩形
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:222:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:223:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:224:  - operation:重建, reconstruct
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:225:  - operation:分层叠放, layered_painting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:226:  - object:投影刻度, projection_tick
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:227:  - object:隐形矩形, invisible_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:228:  - relation:双投影配对, dual_projection_pairing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:229:  - condition:面积决定层序, area_determines_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:230:- 参考题目题号: 11、13
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:231:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:232:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:233:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:234:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:235:把底边与右边两组彩色刻度线段按颜色配对成实心矩形，并按面积从大到小的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:236:次序叠放画出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:237:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:238:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:239:- 黑色背景；最底一行有若干互不重叠的彩色水平线段，最右一列有同一批
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:240:  颜色的竖直线段，两组颜色一一对应。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:241:- 除这两条边外，场景内部完全空白。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:242:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:243:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:244:- 每种颜色：底行线段给出列区间，右列线段给出行区间，二者张成一个实心
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:245:  矩形，画入内部区域。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:246:- 矩形之间可以重叠；重叠处按面积从大到小依次绘制，即面积小的矩形覆盖
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:247:  面积大的矩形。各矩形面积互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:248:- 底行与右列的刻度线段原样保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:249:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:250:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:251:- 两条边不是要延伸的射线源，而是同一批隐形矩形在两面"墙"上的投影；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:252:  参与规则的对象从未被完整画出，且叠放次序由面积这一派生量决定，而非
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:253:  位置或颜色顺序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:254:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:255:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:256:## 8. 灰点陈述孔数的自指筛选
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:257:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:258:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:259:  - operation:裁剪, crop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:260:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:261:  - object:灰点标记, gray_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:262:  - object:带孔物体, holed_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:263:  - relation:自指匹配, self_referential_match
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:264:  - condition:灰点数等于孔数, markers_equal_holes
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:265:- 参考题目题号: 7、14
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:266:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:267:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:268:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:269:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:270:裁剪输出灰点数量恰好等于自身孔洞数量的唯一物体。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:271:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:272:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:273:- 黑色背景上散布若干彩色实心物体，每个物体内部留有若干一格大小的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:274:  黑色孔洞，孔洞数各不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:275:- 每个物体身上贴有若干灰色像素，各物体的灰点数彼此不同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:276:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:277:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:278:- 对每个物体分别数出其内部孔洞数与其所贴灰点数。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:279:- 唯一存在一个物体两数恰好相等；裁剪输出该物体，其中灰点位置还原为
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:280:  物体自身颜色，孔洞保留为黑色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:281:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:282:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:283:- 灰点不是装饰也不是指向别处的选择指针，而是对物体自身一项隐藏属性
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:284:  （孔数）的"陈述"，只有陈述为真的物体被输出；各物体灰点数互不相同，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:285:  使"选灰点最多者""选最大物体"等捷径在跨示例时全部被证伪，第一个
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:286:  示例中被选中者恰好也是最大物体，专作诱饵。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:287:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:288:
