/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:290:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:291:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:292:  - operation:同心层填充, concentric_fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:293:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:294:  - object:空心方框, hollow_square
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/044.md:295:  - object:外部标记像素, outer_marker_pixel
