/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:128:  - 操作:射线延伸
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:129:  - 操作:连线
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:130:  - 对象:边框边
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:131:  - 对象:路由点
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:132:  - 对象:起点缺口
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:133:  - 关系:颜色查表转向
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:134:  - 条件:图例随题面变化
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/003.md:135:  - 条件:串行接力路由
