/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:13:  - object:实心方块, solid_square
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:14:  - object:空心方框, hollow_frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:15:  - object:种子像素, seed_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:16:  - relation:连锁反应, chain_reaction
