/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:112:## 4. 钥匙格镜像马赛克
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:113:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:114:- 参考题目题号：056-17 (c48954c1)、056-15 (247ef758)、056-2 (d4469b4b)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:115:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:116:  - operation:平铺, tiling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:117:  - operation:镜像, mirror
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/1/056.md:118:  - operation:颜色互换, color_swap
